        <properties>
          <defaultvalue>
<![CDATA[
You are about to copy [name of insight], originally created by [name of author / BDO MF]. Before continuing, you may find the following information about this insight useful:

- This insight is intended for CFOs of SMEs in the retail sector with a turnover between 100-500 million euro
- There is an infographic that accompanies this insight: you can request it here (link to email)
- An executive summary can be found here [link]
- We ran a two hour breakfast event that outlined the key findings of the report – details here [link]

For any questions, please contact [link to insight creator’s email]

Remember, in order to proceed, you must check the box to indicate that you agree to comply with the protocol and requirements outlined above
]]>
